\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-180\li180\sl202\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Victoriously, death is swallowed,\cf0 
\par \pard\li180\sl202\slmult0 Death, wither art thy weapon?
\par Death, where is thy victory?
\par Death, where is also thy sting?
\par The power of sin is the Law
\par \i ://: Sin, is the crown of law ://:\tab 
\par \i0 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl202\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Now, we give thanks to our Lord
\par \pard\li180\sl202\slmult0 In honour and in glory.
\par And victory comes from Him.
\par    For in our Lord Jesus Christ,
\par \pard\li315\sl202\slmult0 He who died to save us all,
\par \i ://:Justified when He arose://:
\par \i0 
\par \pard\fi-225\li315\sl202\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Oh death, wither art thy sting?
\par \pard\li315\sl202\slmult0 The victory that you proclaim,
\par Where is it in death's dark vale?
\par Our victory comes from our Lord,
\par Death is swallowed in victory,
\par \pard\i      ://:Christ, the victorious King. ://:\i0\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

